{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape from a demon-infested futuristic colony!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Trapped in a colossal decaying colony, humanity's final shield against the apocalypse, three rebels stumble upon the enigmatic <strong>Exomakers</strong>. These artifacts pulse with power and materialize the wielder's heart essence into mighty battle suits. They rise to face the mechanical horrors lurking within, determined to destroy the root of all evil forever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/26d05667718ce96f0468daf83d6c1418.poster.avif?t=1772403411\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/26d05667718ce96f0468daf83d6c1418.webm?t=1772403411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/26d05667718ce96f0468daf83d6c1418.mp4?t=1772403411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your character:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brave:</strong> Separated from his body and confined in isolation as punishment, he excels in close-quarters combat, making him the ideal pick for beginners. His jabs are swift and powerful, and he can conjure weapons for devastating special attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aurelia:</strong> Genetically altered into a demonic warrior for military purposes, she excels at a safer distance, calling forth Guardians to handle large enemy groups!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>?????:</strong> A technical character with unorthodox gameplay, capable of dominating in skilled hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/80131e280976485077dae47e5251e144.poster.avif?t=1772403411\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/80131e280976485077dae47e5251e144.webm?t=1772403411\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/extras/80131e280976485077dae47e5251e144.mp4?t=1772403411\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulously crafted pixel art graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode with branching paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade mode for quick, intense action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls meet deep gameplay: Swap weapons for attack bonuses and unleash devastating combos with well-timed strikes!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game is a work in progress!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Roborar Digital\u2019s social media for updates on the game\u2019s development!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3368080?t=1772403411","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772403411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/5d4f486af8fde36757c2d93b65fdb93787b83db1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772403411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3368080/5d4f486af8fde36757c2d93b65fdb93787b83db1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772403411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"St